    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Jönsson et al. (2006) & Smith et al. (2006) up-the-gradient PIN1 polarization with explicit PIN1 trafficking kinetics, quasi-3D subepidermal canalization, and polar auxin transport for shoot apical meristem phyllotaxis — Source and data traceability: 86/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Credited: 11 primary sources with DOIs in the audit, 12 BibTeX entries in the vendored bib (7 added in Pass 3, each DOI resolved against Crossref: 10.1038/35096571, 10.1038/nature03633, 10.1101/gad.497009, 10.1098/rspb.1980.0015, 10.1098/rstb.1981.0154, 10.1016/j.jtbi.2005.03.017, 10.1101/gad.1402406); the reference JSON (schema 1.1.0) records the new trafficking and canalization parameter blocks with their sources; all four dataset files are SHA-256 pinned and verified fail-closed at every run (L96-122) with the two edited files re-pinned; the Aeonium specimen carries its Wikimedia title, URL and CC BY-SA 3.0 licence. Deductions: the `scout_manifest.json` still names `datasets/auxin_pin1_meristem` and `Loop_032_auxin_pin1_meristem.lean` as the proposed paths, which do not match the delivered files (-4); the 'empirical' values in the reference JSON (mode Gamma values, 0.84, 2.68, 2.85, lambda_c 5.2) cite papers without figure/table/page pinpoints (-6); the PM-fraction 0.9 and strand 1-2 cell references are qualitative readings of figures, stated as such but not digitised (-4)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/source-traceability" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/scout_manifest.json L12–L16: proposed_dataset_dir / proposed_lean_module do not match the delivered paths (stale scout record) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/d58a084/datasets/auxin_pin1_phyllotaxis/scout_manifest.json#L12-L16>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-source-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-source-traceability-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-jonsson-auxin-pin1-meristem-source-traceability-3> ;
